---
import AppLayout from '../../../../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import OpenEvoStage1VersionComparison from '../../../../../../components/research/OpenEvoStage1VersionComparison.astro';
import OpenEvoCapabilityExperimentTree from '../../../../../../components/research/OpenEvoCapabilityExperimentTree.astro';
import OpenEvoStage2StrategyChooser from '../../../../../../components/research/OpenEvoStage2StrategyChooser.astro';
import OpenEvoExperimentAnalysisPlanIndex from '../../../../../../components/research/OpenEvoExperimentAnalysisPlanIndex.astro';
const locale = 'en' as const;
---
<AppLayout
  title="OpenEvo capability exploration experiments"
  description="OpenEvo × WebShop capability exploration: retain historical Stage-2 and Ceiling-1.0 evidence. Current authority keeps 7B Ceiling Stage2 active while 3B is BLOCKED_HARNESS_READINESS; Harness 2.0.1 mechanical qualification is PASS but formal 3B Stage2 is not authorized."
  locale={locale}
>
  <section class="capability-series" data-testid="openevo-capability-exploration-series">
    <header class="capability-series__header">
      <p>OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · CAPABILITY EXPLORATION</p>
      <h1>OpenEvo capability exploration experiments</h1>
      <div>
        <strong>The current corrected Stage 1 remains the shared starting point. The first Harness 2.0 paired 128+128 qualification is complete, and the later Harness 2.0.1 mechanical qualification has also passed; its scientific closeout is still HOLD_FOR_STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT, so formal 3B Stage 2 is not authorized.</strong>
        <span>Harness 2.0.1 mechanical PASS is not formal activation: the current record states formal_stage2_authorized=false and final_panel_access_authorized=false. The next phase has moved from “build 2.0.1” to STAGE2_READINESS_AUDIT_AND_DRESS_REHEARSAL; only an explicit readiness release can authorize 3B Stage 2 again.</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <OpenEvoCapabilityExperimentTree locale={locale} />
    <OpenEvoStage1VersionComparison locale={locale} />
    <OpenEvoStage2StrategyChooser locale={locale} active="index" />
    <OpenEvoExperimentAnalysisPlanIndex locale={locale} />
  </section>
</AppLayout>

<style>
.capability-series{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto 4rem}
.capability-series__header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:1.5rem;align-items:end;padding:1.4rem 0 1.1rem}
.capability-series__header>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .68rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.09em}
.capability-series__header h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.capability-series__header div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.45rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.capability-series__header strong{color:var(--ink);font-size:1rem}
.capability-series__header span{font-size:.88rem}
.capability-series :global(.analysis-plan-index){max-width:none;padding-inline:0}
@media(max-width:760px){.capability-series{width:min(100% - .75rem,1180px)}.capability-series__header{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.55rem;padding:1rem 0 .75rem}.capability-series__header>p{grid-column:auto}.capability-series__header h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,11vw,3rem);line-height:1.02}.capability-series__header div{font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.5}.capability-series__header strong{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.45}.capability-series__header span{display:none}}
</style>
